System Principles

Registers = People

Reports = Activity

Users ≠ Residents

Call Sign ≠ System ID

Permissions control everything

12. Crime Intelligence Module

Purpose:

Build historical intelligence over time

Track Persons of Interest, Vehicles of Interest, and Places of Interest

Link observations across sectors, incidents, patrols, and reports

Support future spider-map / node-link visualisation

Core intelligence entity types:

POI = Person of Interest

VOI = Vehicle of Interest

LOI = Location / Place of Interest

Group / Organisation

Other

Key principle:

POI / VOI / LOI must not only live inside incident reports.

They must be stored as reusable intelligence entities.

If the same VOI is seen in Sector A and later in Sector B, the system must allow linking those observations together.

Crime intelligence structure:

Intelligence Entities

Fields:

intelligence_entity_id

entity_type

display_name

description

risk_level

status

created_at

updated_at

POI Person Details

Fields:

poi_detail_id

intelligence_entity_id

first_name

last_name

