notes

Intelligence Links / Spider Map

Fields:

intelligence_link_id

from_entity_id

to_entity_id

link_type

confidence_level

notes

created_at

Example link types:

ASSOCIATED_WITH

SEEN_AT

OWNS

DRIVES

LINKED_TO_INCIDENT

FREQUENTS

SUSPECTED_CONNECTION

Incident Intelligence Links

Fields:

incident_intelligence_link_id

incident_id

intelligence_entity_id

role_in_incident

notes

Example roles:

Suspect

Witness

Vehicle used

Location involved

Mentioned

Future view:

Spider map showing nodes and links

Example: VOI seen in Sector A → linked to POI → linked to Incident → later seen in Sector B

